#!/usr/bin/env bash
cat <<'EOF'

  __  __ _       ___  ____
 |  \/  (_)_ __ / _ \/ ___|
 | |\/| | | '_ \ | | \___ \
 | |  | | | | | | |_| |___) |
 |_|  |_|_|_| |_|\___/|____/

Tiny Arch-based rescue OS. You are root; be careful with disk commands.

Wi-Fi:       iwctl
Disks:       lsblk -f
Mount root:  mount /dev/ROOT /mnt
Arch chroot: arch-chroot /mnt
Any chroot:  minos-chroot /mnt
Network:     ip addr; ping archlinux.org
Hardware:    lspci -k; lsusb; dmesg -T

EOF

